Apple considered launching a <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/homepod/">HomePod</a> with a camera and additional sensors years before the upcoming "<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/03/06/homepad-now-rumored-to-launch-even-later/">HomePad</a>" device, <a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/features/2026-apple-next-ceo/"><em>Bloomberg</em></a>'s <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/mark-gurman/">Mark Gurman</a> reports.<br/>
